      "role": "user",
      "content": "i just feel like everything i touch gets ruined. i messed up so bad with my family and now i can see it in their eyes... they're just tired of dealing with me. i feel like such a weight on everyone. like i'm just constantly draining the people i love most and there's no way to fix it.",
